      "text": "WHEREAS, the Unions and the City of New York agree that the Additional Member Contributions required of the Covered Sanitation Employees as part of the benefit enhancements provided by the Elections should be picked up by the City for purposes of federal income tax treatment under section 414(h) of the Internal Revenue Code; and",
