    {
      "bbox": [
        292,
        1408,
        1503,
        1956
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. The City, through the Office of Payroll Administration, shall pick up the Additional Member Contributions required of the Covered Sanitation Employees pursuant to the Elections on and after the effective date of the Elections and shall do so by reducing the salary of each of the Covered Sanitation Employees by that amount which each such Covered Employee is required to contribute under the Elections. The Additional Member Contributions so picked up shall be paid by the City in lieu of the Additional Member Contributions to be paid by Covered Employees pursuant to the Elections and shall be treated as employer contributions solely for the purposes of determining federal income tax treatment under section 414(h) of the United States Internal Revenue Code.",
